OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold start with widespread
OL,6,Frural frost. Remaining cold through
OL,7,Fthe day, though there will be long
OL,8,Fspells of autumn sunshine for some
OL,9,Fthis morning. Cloud arriving later to
OL,10,Fdim the afternoon sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will become breezy as a
OL,13,Fband of rain arrives this evening. The
OL,14,Frain will be mostly light with
OL,15,Fisolated heavier bursts. Feeling cold,
OL,16,Fbut without the risk of frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
